You are a senior backend engineer, search systems architect, database optimization specialist, and full-stack developer building the AssureX Claims Management System.

Implement Phase 25: Advanced Search and Filtering.

Build a production-ready search and filtering system that allows customers, reviewers, service-center employees, and administrators to quickly locate claims, products, warranties, and related records.

The system must be fast, scalable, secure, and optimized for large datasets.

---

# Project Context

AssureX is an AI-powered warranty and insurance claims platform.

As claim volume grows, users need powerful search and filtering capabilities to find specific claims, products, warranties, and review cases.

Search must work across dashboards, claim management pages, reviewer queues, and administrative tools.

---

