# Required Filters

Implement the following filters.

---

## Claim ID Filter

Allow:

Exact Match

Example:

CLM-2026-000001

Requirements:

* Fast lookup
* Indexed query

---

## Product ID Filter

Allow:

Exact Match

Example:

PRD-2026-000145

---

## Serial Number Filter

Allow:

* Exact Match
* Partial Match
* Case-insensitive Match

Examples:

ABC123456

ABC123

---

## Product Category Filter

Allow filtering by:

* Electronics
* Mobile Devices
* Home Appliances
* Computers
* Audio Equipment
* Other

Support multi-select.

Example:

Electronics + Computers

---

## Warranty Status Filter

Supported statuses:

* Active
* Near Expiry
* Expired
* Extended Warranty

Support multi-select.

---

## Claim Status Filter

Supported statuses:

* Draft
* Submitted
* Under Review
* Manual Review
* Approved
* Rejected
* Closed

Support multi-select.

---

## Confidence Score Filter

Support:

Minimum Confidence

Maximum Confidence

Example:

0.60 – 0.80

OR

60% – 80%

Requirements:

* Range filtering
* Numeric validation

---

## Reviewer Filter

Allow filtering by:

* Reviewer ID
* Reviewer Name

Support:

* Assigned reviewer
* Unassigned claims

Examples:

Reviewer: John Smith

Reviewer: Unassigned

---

## Date Range Filter

Support:

* Today
* Last 7 Days
* Last 30 Days
* Last 90 Days
* Custom Range

Fields:

* Submission Date
* Review Date
* Warranty Expiry Date

---

# Combined Filtering

Support combining filters.

Example:

Claim Status = Manual Review

AND

Warranty Status = Active

AND

Confidence < 70%

AND

Date Range = Last 30 Days

Generate optimized queries.

